14-cis-eicosatetraenoic acid\", \"5(S)-HPETE\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-266010\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-266010.4\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"5S-HpETE is dehydrated to LTA4 by ALOX5\", \"(5S)-hydroperoxy-(6E,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate => H2O + leukotriene A4\", \"Dehydration of 5-HpETE to leukotriene A4\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 265281, \"displayName\": \"LTA4 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LTA4\", \"leukotriene A4(1-)\", \"leukotriene A4\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10675188], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-265281\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-265281.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29356, \"displayName\": \"H2O [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H2O\", \"water\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10675188], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29356\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29356.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10675108, \"displayName\": \"Arachidonate is oxidised to 5S-HpETE by ALOX5\", \"followingEvent\": [10675188], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Arachidonate is oxidised to 5S-HpETE by ALOX5\", \"(5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate + O2 => (5S)-hydroperoxy-(6E,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate\", \"Oxidation of arachidonic acid to 5-HpETE\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"stId\": \"R-XTR-265296\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-XTR-265296.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"XTR\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 205621, \"displayName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"name\": [\"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"Western clawed frog\", \"Silurana tropicalis\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"8364\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"stId\": \"R-XTR-266051\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-XTR-266051.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\"}]}" ;
